-### [Median-Cut](13179-median-cut.md)
-A method to build a spatial hierarchy bottom-up by choosing the direction and position of splits carefully. It differs from standard median-cut color quantization by applying the split logic to spatial bounding boxes rather than color histograms, and it specifically employs the Surface Area Heuristic (SAH) to optimize the split position and direction, distinguishing it from simple geometric median splits. Choose when ray-tracing or surface-area-based cost models are preferred over pure volume reduction.
